<%- include('header') %><section class="workspace"><a class="back" href="/dashboard">← My prompts</a><div class="heading-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">MONETIZATION</p><h1>Earnings and eligibility</h1></div><span class="pill <%= monetization.status === 'monetized' ? 'published' : '' %>"><%= monetization.status === 'scheduled' ? 'STARTS NEXT MONTH' : monetization.status === 'monetized' ? 'MONETIZED' : monetization.status === 'paused' ? 'PAUSED' : 'BUILDING' %></span></div><section class="monetization-card card"><div><h2>Your visitor milestone</h2><p class="muted"><strong><%= monetization.currentMonthVisitors.toLocaleString() %></strong> measured visitors this calendar month · <strong><%= monetization.previousMonthVisitors.toLocaleString() %></strong> last completed month.</p></div><div class="progress-grid"><div><span>This month</span><strong><%= monetization.currentMonthVisitors.toLocaleString() %> / 50,000</strong></div><div><span>Last month</span><strong><%= monetization.previousMonthVisitors.toLocaleString() %> / 50,000</strong></div></div><p class="muted full"><strong>50,000 visitors in a calendar month starts monetization on the first day of the following month.</strong> Visitors are a progress signal; actual payout uses finalized ad revenue and manual approval.</p></section><p class="lead compact">Creator share is <strong>50% of net distributable revenue</strong>: finalized creator-attributed ad revenue minus invalid-traffic reversals, revenue-specific taxes, and direct payout costs. General platform costs are not deducted from creator earnings.</p><div class="calculator-grid"><form class="card stack" id="earnings-form"><h2>Illustrative calculator</h2><label>Monthly page views<input name="pageViews" type="number" value="<%= Math.max(monetization.currentMonthVisitors, 50000) %>" min="0" max="1000000000" step="1" required></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Ad slots per page<input name="slots" type="number" value="1" min="0" max="4" step="1" required></label><label>Ad fill rate (%)<input name="fillRate" type="number" value="70" min="0" max="100" step="1" required></label></div><label>Ad revenue per 1,000 filled impressions (USD)<input name="ecpm" type="number" value="1" min="0" max="1000" step="0.01" required><small>$1 is only an example. Use the settled publisher eCPM when ads are live.</small></label><label>Creator share (%)<input name="creatorShare" type="number" value="<%= monetization.creatorSharePercent %>" min="0" max="100" step="1" required><small>Share applies after the documented revenue-specific deductions above.</small></label><button class="button" type="submit">Calculate estimate</button></form><section class="card estimate" aria-live="polite"><p class="eyebrow">ILLUSTRATIVE MONTHLY ESTIMATE</p><h2>Creator’s share</h2><output id="creator-earning">$17.50</output><div class="estimate-row"><span>Filled ad impressions</span><strong id="impressions">35,000</strong></div><div class="estimate-row"><span>Total ad revenue</span><strong id="total-earning">$35.00</strong></div><div class="estimate-row"><span>Platform share, before direct costs</span><strong id="platform-earning">$17.50</strong></div><p class="formula">Page views × slots × fill rate ÷ 1,000 × publisher eCPM</p><p class="muted">This does not create a balance. In the first phase, approved payouts are sent manually by UPI and recorded in the creator’s monthly ledger.</p><p class="alert" id="calculator-error" hidden></p></section></div></section><%- include('footer') %>
